(7 WONDERS - Demo Rulebook \(Board Game Cafe\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(OVERVIEW) Tj T*
(Players lead ancient cities over three ages. They build structures, develop their) Tj T*
(wonder and fight their two neighbours. Everyone plays at the same time.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SETUP) Tj T*
(Each player takes a wonder board and 3 coins. Each age uses a deck of cards prepared) Tj T*
(for the number of players; each player is dealt 7 cards.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(A TURN) Tj T*
(Everyone chooses one card from their hand at the same time and then:) Tj T*
(- builds the structure \(pays its cost in resources or coins\), or) Tj T*
(- builds the next stage of their wonder, tucking the card under the board, or) Tj T*
(- discards the card to gain 3 coins.) Tj T*
(Then pass the remaining cards to a neighbour: to the left in Ages I and III, to the) Tj T*
(right in Age II. After 6 turns, the 7th card of each hand is discarded.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(RESOURCES AND TRADING) Tj T*
(Resources come from brown and gray cards and from the wonder board. You may buy a) Tj T*
(missing resource from a neighbour for 2 coins; some yellow cards reduce this price.) Tj T*
(Some buildings are free if you already own the building they chain from.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
