(MILITARY CONFLICT) Tj T*
(At the end of each age, compare your shields with each neighbour. The player with more) Tj T*
(shields gains a victory token: 1 point in Age I, 3 points in Age II, 5 points in Age) Tj T*
(III. The player with fewer shields takes a -1 defeat token. A tie gives nothing.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(FINAL SCORING) Tj T*
(- Military tokens.) Tj T*
(- Treasury: 1 point for every 3 coins.) Tj T*
(- Wonder stages.) Tj T*
(- Civilian structures \(blue cards\).) Tj T*
(- Scientific structures \(green cards\): each group of identical symbols scores the) Tj T*
(   number of) Tj T*
(symbols squared, and each set of three different symbols scores 7 extra points.) Tj T*
(- Commercial structures \(yellow\) and guilds \(purple\) as printed.) Tj T*
(The player with the most points wins. On a tie, the richest player wins.) Tj T*
ET
